<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to refer certain matters relating to water
management to the Commonwealth Parliament; to amend the <legref
refid="act-2000-092" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Water Management Act 2000</i></name></legref> and other
Acts; and to repeal the <legref refid="act-1992-065" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Murray&#8211;Darling Basin Act
1992</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


