<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_e66fd0ad-9248-4bfa-9ee2-c3a6386ede1c"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_89aca4ed-59a1-4522-9709-cd2ddf59389e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_1304403c-0f64-4d99-8435-1771e7d7a0e0"
id="sec.3-def.amendmentreference"><b><i>amendment reference</i></b></defterm>
means the reference under section 4 (1) (b).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_1b8d611a-eab1-4bd2-8e96-d6d7c083bc8b"
id="sec.3-def.Basinwaterresources"><b><i>Basin water
resources</i></b></defterm> means water resources within or beneath that part
of this State that comprises the Murray-Darling Basin (as defined in the
terms, or substantially in the terms, set out in the initial referred
provisions), but does not include ground water resources of the Great Artesian
Basin.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_089ff700-8f81-4444-afe5-30dfd41644a5"
id="sec.3-def.CommonwealthWaterAct"><b><i>Commonwealth Water
Act</i></b></defterm> means the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Water Act 2007</i></name></legref> of
the Commonwealth, as in force from time to time.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c371d2b2-f3e3-4020-a331-c2dc50da2cb0"
id="sec.3-def.CommonwealthWaterActinstrument"><b><i>Commonwealth Water Act
instrument</i></b></defterm> means any instrument (whether or not of a
legislative character) that is made or issued under the Commonwealth Water
Act.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_60438b58-6fdd-4e8e-98fc-77b1e5ce531e"
id="sec.3-def.criticalhumanwaterneeds"><b><i>critical human water
needs</i></b></defterm> means the needs for a minimum amount of water, that
can only reasonably be provided from Basin water resources, required to
meet:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3911acdb-8c02-4b3e-9235-0ea05ac1628c" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">core human consumption requirements in urban and
rural areas, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9f46ef1f-8461-422f-86f8-de00c78c29a0" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">those non-human consumption requirements that a
failure to meet would cause prohibitively high social, economic or national
security costs.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_f2878bb0-fce5-4e23-9ec6-19c434c70872"
id="sec.3-def.expressamendment"><b><i>express amendment</i></b></defterm> of
the Commonwealth Water Act means the direct amendment of the text of Parts 1A,
2A, 4, 4A, 10A and 11A of that Act or of definitions of terms used in those
Parts (whether by the insertion, omission, repeal, substitution or relocation
of words or matter) by another Commonwealth Act or by an instrument under a
Commonwealth Act, but does not include the enactment by a Commonwealth Act of
a provision that has or will have substantive effect otherwise than as part of
the text of those Parts or those definitions.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_3d3fb534-e37e-41a8-bd86-c4cf332103dc"
id="sec.3-def.initialreference"><b><i>initial reference</i></b></defterm>
means the reference under section 4 (1) (a).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_a0b3b2a7-14cd-4614-a8e8-9d460f1a8ca9"
id="sec.3-def.initialreferredprovisions"><b><i>initial referred
provisions</i></b></defterm> means the text of Parts 1A, 2A, 4, 4A, 10A and
11A set out in the tabled text.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_6e3dbe9d-b644-4b65-8f12-4bbe0253c841"
id="sec.3-def.MurrayDarlingBasinAgreement"><b><i>Murray-Darling Basin
Agreement</i></b></defterm> means the Murray-Darling Basin Agreement (a copy
of which is set out in the tabled text), as amended from time to time by the
parties to that Agreement in accordance with the procedure set out in that
Agreement.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_62efc4cd-174b-4220-9cde-614fe7fb1197"
id="sec.3-def.reference"><b><i>reference</i></b></defterm> means:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_609132aa-ec23-458f-9d74-9962133a5eb9" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a-oc.2">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the initial reference, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_08bea9e6-c3e4-4040-a610-06ce180d871e" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b-oc.2">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the amendment
reference.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_8141f62a-45c3-45ce-99c7-524eb4664c68"
id="sec.3-def.referredsubjectmatters"><b><i>referred
subject-matters</i></b></defterm> means any of the following:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c824f685-ae3a-409f-9253-39dda39316d7" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a-oc.3">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the powers, functions and duties of Commonwealth
agencies that:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9d98d7b5-998b-44fd-a883-c5bb8369c743"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a-oc.3-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">relate to Basin water resources,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_17e24c77-8c53-427d-a91d-5dc7df196b29"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a-oc.3-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">are conferred by or under the Murray-Darling
Basin Agreement,</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1bdc04b6-cdf0-4619-8797-61f5e0be4145" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b-oc.3">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the management of Basin water resources to meet
critical human water needs,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_def9a465-5c16-4dc2-8281-1b8a2ce3cccd" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">water charging in relation to Basin water
resources (other than for urban water supply after the removal of the water
from a Basin water resource),</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b0a891b4-4712-46e7-bac8-8e89bc11f475" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the transformation of entitlements to water from
a Basin water resource to enable trading in those water
entitlements,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fdf46979-5b8e-49a9-963a-6b8749cc51b4" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the application, in relation to water resources
that are not Basin water resources, of provisions of the Commonwealth Water
Act dealing with the subject-matters specified in paragraphs (c) and (d)
(being an application of a kind that is authorised by the law of this
State),</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0b3b8161-b035-4b02-b073-68203135e673" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.f">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the transfer of assets, rights and liabilities of
the Murray-Darling Basin Commission to the Murray-Darling Basin Authority
established by the Commonwealth Water Act, and other transitional matters
relating to the replacement of that Commission.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c48c7805-76b8-47be-8a22-00b4b0e0ee6e"
id="sec.3-def.tabledtext"><b><i>tabled text</i></b></defterm> means the text
of the proposed <legref jurisd="CTH" type="bill" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Water Amendment Bill 2008</i></name></legref> for a
Commonwealth Act as tabled by or on behalf of the Minister for the River
Murray in the House of Assembly of South Australia on 23 September
2008.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_92f1572f-0ee1-4b9a-8933-88e7ea512a4e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A reference in this Act to a Part of (or to be
inserted in) the Commonwealth Water Act includes a reference to any Schedule
to (or to be inserted in) that Act that contains provisions enacted for the
purposes of that Part.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_02ff7107-18f2-4361-ab5e-359d048808b9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_a674e900-dd1e-4785-99ec-ea42bbb39742"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Reference of matters</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_550bbdf1-972f-4919-aeef-5b041bd3cb7f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The following matters are referred to the
Parliament of the Commonwealth:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f88fa570-76c6-4644-b963-c388c74e3d7a" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the matters to which the initial referred
provisions relate, but only to the extent of the making of laws with respect
to those matters by including the initial referred provisions in the
Commonwealth Water Act in the terms, or substantially in the terms, set out in
Schedule 1 of the tabled text,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f38e8bbf-65eb-4a29-8751-90d89f8e3cce" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the referred subject-matters, but only to the
extent of the making of laws with respect to any such matter by making express
amendments of the Commonwealth Water Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fbffce32-f8a9-46b0-8c36-d4b63c22c8dc"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The reference of a matter under subsection (1)
has effect only:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_538f617c-9a4a-4523-aa90-68ade9e28809" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if and to the extent that the matter is not
included in the legislative powers of the Parliament of the Commonwealth
(otherwise than by a reference for the purposes of section 51 (xxxvii) of the
Constitution of the Commonwealth), and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b0646c88-c652-4ab7-865e-5f35a6ebbd12" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if and to the extent that the matter is included
in the legislative powers of the Parliament of this
State.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f513dc60-039a-4eae-82f6-6a4f179381fe"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The operation of each paragraph of subsection (1)
is not affected by the other paragraph.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0d156a7b-a562-4c00-9bbe-de61ea5e005d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the avoidance of doubt, it is the intention
of the Parliament of this State that:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d9ad8282-62ea-40d3-b291-1ecf0b2bf2e6" id="sec.4-ssec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Commonwealth Water Act may be expressly
amended, or have its operation otherwise affected, at any time after the
commencement of this Act by provisions of Commonwealth Acts whose operation is
based on legislative powers that the Parliament of the Commonwealth has apart
from under the references under subsection (1), and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fbb822d1-4a50-4f55-889a-72c2f7f78872" id="sec.4-ssec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Commonwealth Water Act may at any time have
its operation affected, otherwise than by express amendment, at any time by
provisions of Commonwealth Water Act instruments.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_48eef7b9-0a7c-498d-aa92-0751f8e16be1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Despite any other provision of this section, a
reference under this section has effect for a period:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_de3c9175-df32-42f9-b664-7b2cae522d8f" id="sec.4-ssec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">beginning when this section commences,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c63a7bb3-3acc-4bea-b853-d61e116363a6" id="sec.4-ssec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">ending at the end of the day fixed under section
5 as the day on which the reference is to
terminate,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">but no longer.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bcc2bd65-15af-4735-95a0-4d18ffe12ce8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_7f983d92-51c5-4a6f-b75b-2749d03a9b62"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Termination of references</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b179b4c6-f086-41ce-b29c-ae7fd12cef18"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may, at any time, by proclamation
published on the NSW legislation website, fix a day as the day on
which:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_dac4a90f-5b65-4bb6-9790-aa9c29db856a" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the references terminate, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8295d55f-9328-4832-a23f-4b62a626d0b1" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the amendment reference
terminates.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6fd7351a-5888-47a4-9247-c981304b1b68"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may, by proclamation published on
the NSW legislation website, revoke a proclamation published under subsection
(1), in which case the revoked proclamation is taken (for the purposes of
section 4) never to have been published.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a85b58cb-7665-4ae1-9dac-8b8c783525df"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A revoking proclamation has effect only if
published before the day fixed under subsection (1).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0d2dc554-3b70-4cb3-9a26-18713d478e0f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The revocation of a proclamation published under
subsection (1) does not prevent publication of a further proclamation under
that subsection.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e140b1e0-2138-4de3-b2f7-89abf90bb4aa"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If the amendment reference has terminated, the
expression <defterm type="definition"
guid="_2aad9b8d-4bac-4c05-81a2-9f40e23a30d5"
id="sec.5-def.thereferences"><b><i>the references</i></b></defterm> in
subsection (1) (a) refers to the initial reference only.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 5:</b> Am 2009 No 106,
Sch 3.44.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6288ab51-412b-4597-863a-c74a9589c2b9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_cac4f9b6-4472-4fa6-8715-2e7ff2dcbccd"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Effect of termination of amendment reference before initial
reference</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4fdede8e-292c-42ab-b492-96876831e45e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If the amendment reference terminates before the
initial reference, the termination of the amendment reference does not
affect:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d14f61b1-0bee-4333-89e2-c0997cf4d8ba" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">laws that were made under the amendment reference
before that termination (whether or not they have come into operation before
that termination), or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8a102f53-9755-40f2-ae30-4ee36221039c" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the continued operation in the State of the
Commonwealth Water Act as in operation immediately before that termination or
as subsequently amended or affected by:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0143cb00-a10e-46b3-b2f5-37070c889845"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">laws referred to in paragraph (a) that come into
operation after that termination, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e76ba170-38eb-4009-805d-d6a8885a8e22"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">provisions referred to in section 4 (4) (a) or
(b).</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8f3707ce-e2f2-4bba-b3e4-5ba3710afaa7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Accordingly, the amendment reference continues to
have effect for the purposes of subsection (1) unless the initial reference is
terminated.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_769e8b2a-94bf-466a-aeae-1106c4334e74"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (1) does not apply to or in relation
to an amendment of the Commonwealth Water Act that is excluded from the
operation of this section by the proclamation that terminates the amendment
reference.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cc4319c6-65bf-489d-9221-aa028ead37ee"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purposes of subsection (1):</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ddbe7a32-122a-4e36-a869-ac2eedb04c5a" id="sec.6-ssec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the laws referred to in subsection (1) (a)
include Commonwealth Water Act instruments, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_99b577cd-a542-4637-9eea-c24f99d5ffd1" id="sec.6-ssec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the reference in subsection (1) (b) to the
Commonwealth Water Act as in operation immediately before the termination of
the amendment reference includes that legislation as affected by Commonwealth
Water Act instruments that have come into operation before that
time.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2dced870-4af2-4509-a88b-c3b4d1f6e6ae"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_7fb08ce6-c40f-4767-b634-b37400beaaa7"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Evidence</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0c017a05-2d0e-414c-bd10-7c1aa71ebe30"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A certificate of the Clerk of the House of
Assembly of South Australia certifying that a document is an accurate copy of
the tabled text, or is an accurate copy of a particular part or of particular
provisions of the tabled text, is admissible in evidence in any proceedings
and is evidence:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6771ffce-8e68-4aa9-a946-aeb708ff475d" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">of the matter certified, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ebef178d-3f40-4b05-b38b-143240859d6a" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">that the text of the proposed Commonwealth Bill
was tabled in the House of Assembly of South Australia as referred to in the
definition of <defterm type="definition"
guid="_a13156cb-8bf2-48c2-9d71-d9b107edc1d8"
id="sec.7-ssec.1-def.tabledtext"><b><i>tabled text</i></b></defterm> in
section 3.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_341adb46-34f4-422e-bc04-146778e6953e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (1) does not affect any other way in
which the tabling or content of the tabled text, or the accuracy of a copy of
the tabled text or of a part or provisions of the tabled text, may be
established.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


